    "Prioritize" : {
      "comment" : "A menu-bar submenu that picks the decks whose cards come first, while none is picked.\nAn item of a deck's menu in the Cards window, on its row in the sidebar or in the Actions menu above the card list, ticked while the deck is a priority deck, and off while it's set aside.",
